      "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#dimension_84fa662f",
      "@type": "OverallIntent",
      "instance_name": "overallintent_instance",
      "label": "the overallintent",
      "description": "meme-id: historical_spacecraft_explosion; hasOverallIntent: None; overall-intent-description: The image depicts a rocket launch with a bright flame and smoke trail against a twilight sky, with the text 'historical spacecraft explosion' overlaid. There is no toxicity present as the image does not contain any disparaging metaphors, stereotypes, or harmful content related to any protected group. The intent appears to be a misleading or ironic juxtaposition, as the image shows a successful rocket launch, not an explosion. The text falsely labels a launch as an 'explosion,' which may be intended to create humor or confusion, but it does not target any specific group or promote hate, abuse, or harmful content. The meme's intent is likely satirical or ironic, but it does not meet the criteria for any of the listed toxicities.",
