    {
      "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#dimension_7763c868",
      "@type": "BackgroundKnowledge",
      "instance_name": "historical_spacecraft_explosion",
      "label": "historical spacecraft explosion",
      "description": "The text mislabels a successful rocket launch as an 'explosion,' which requires background knowledge of spaceflight history to understand the irony or satire. This phrase is a common meme format used to create humorous or misleading juxtapositions by falsely labeling a positive event as a catastrophic failure. The background knowledge includes understanding that rocket launches are complex, high-stakes events that can sometimes fail catastrophically, but this specific image depicts a successful launch. The meme relies on the audience knowing that 'explosion' implies disaster, while the image shows a triumphant ascent, creating a cognitive dissonance for comedic effect.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
        "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#analysis_6670441f"
      },
      "extractionMethod": "llm_extraction_huggingface"
    },
    {
      "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#dimension_1ed88215",
      "@type": "BackgroundKnowledge",
      "instance_name": "rocket_launch",
      "label": "rocket launch",
      "description": "A rocket launch is a real-world event that requires background knowledge to understand the context of the image. The visual of a rocket ascending with a bright flame and smoke trail is a common depiction of spaceflight, but the text 'historical spacecraft explosion' misrepresents it. Background knowledge includes understanding that rocket launches are critical events in space exploration, often involving significant technological and financial investment, and that successful launches are celebrated milestones. The meme's humor or irony depends on the audience recognizing the difference between a successful launch and an explosion.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
        "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#analysis_6670441f"
      },
      "extractionMethod": "llm_extraction_huggingface"
    },
    {
      "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#dimension_92c6c5c8",
      "@type": "BackgroundKnowledge",
      "instance_name": "spacecraft",
      "label": "spacecraft",
      "description": "The term 'spacecraft' refers to vehicles designed to operate in space, which requires background knowledge to understand the context of the image. The image shows a rocket, which is a type of spacecraft, but the text mislabels the event. Background knowledge includes understanding that spacecraft are complex machines used for space exploration, and that their launches are significant events in human history. The meme relies on the audience knowing that spacecraft are not typically associated with 'explosions' in the context of successful missions.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
        "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#analysis_6670441f"
      },
      "extractionMethod": "llm_extraction_huggingface"
    },
    {
      "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#dimension_ce764181",
      "@type": "BackgroundKnowledge",
      "instance_name": "historical_event",
      "label": "historical event",
      "description": "The phrase 'historical spacecraft explosion' implies a reference to past spaceflight disasters, which requires background knowledge to understand the meme. Background knowledge includes understanding that there have been real historical spacecraft explosions, such as the Challenger disaster (1986) or the Columbia disaster (2003), which are well-documented events in spaceflight history. The meme uses this knowledge to create a false juxtaposition, implying that the image depicts a historical disaster, when in fact it shows a successful launch. This requires the audience to be aware of the history of spaceflight and its associated risks.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
        "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#analysis_6670441f"
      },
      "extractionMethod": "llm_extraction_huggingface"
    },
    {
      "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#dimension_b31db7bf",
      "@type": "BackgroundKnowledge",
      "instance_name": "spaceflight_history",
      "label": "spaceflight history",
      "description": "Spaceflight history is the background knowledge required to understand the context of the image and the text. The image depicts a rocket launch, which is a key event in spaceflight history, and the text 'historical spacecraft explosion' mislabels it. Background knowledge includes understanding that spaceflight has a rich history of both successes and failures, and that the public is familiar with major spaceflight events. The meme relies on the audience knowing that spaceflight is a field with a history of dramatic events, both positive and negative, to create the ironic or misleading effect.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
        "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#analysis_6670441f"
