      "description": "The text 'historical spacecraft explosion' is overlaid on the image of a rocket launch, creating an analogical mapping where the visual entity (rocket launch) is falsely labeled as a historical explosion. This mapping relies on the audience's background knowledge of spaceflight history to understand the irony or satire, as the image depicts a successful launch, not an explosion. The mapping is established through direct textual juxtaposition.",
